Project > Clean vanilla files from workspace... (or right-click a mod folder / file > Clean vanilla
files) compares each workspace file the game also has with the game's own version (the update's if
it has one, else the DT files'; decompressed, as extraction writes it), after a size check, and lists
the identical ones; on Yes they are moved to <workspace>_removed_vanilla/<date>/ (same paths) and the
folders they leave empty are deleted. Packages holding only such files are then no longer rebuilt.

